# Wave-4 queue (2026-09-11): ~20MB, regenerated deterministically by
# scripts/mine_announcement_residue.py queue. Its OUTPUTS — wave4_chunks/,
# wave4_verdicts/, wave4_result.json, residue_manifest.json — are committed,
# because load_announcement_links.py reads the packets and the result file and
# a clean checkout without them loses every wave-4 citation.
announcements/wave4_queue/
announcements/wave4_lexicon/
